  "clips": [
    {
      "id": "6b58395eba556d9c",
      "voice": "woman",
      "text": "Earl, it's Dolores out on the Hondo road. The lights are back over the mesa. Same as last fall.",
      "sources": [
        {
          "file": "src/core/radio.ts",
          "line": 114,
          "group": "NIGHT_LINE"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c5b91ca2af30f268",
      "voice": "man",
      "text": "Anybody else lose the TV a little after two? Just a hum, most of a minute. Then it came back.",
      "sources": [
        {
          "file": "src/core/radio.ts",
          "line": 119,
          "group": "NIGHT_LINE"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d1e6ef4fee8a9f83",
      "voice": "man",
      "text": "My dog won't come out from under the trailer. He's been under there since one.",
      "sources": [
        {
          "file": "src/core/radio.ts",
          "line": 127,
          "group": "NIGHT_LINE"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "67c97482c2fe4f9f",
      "voice": "boy",
      "text": "Hello? Is this the radio? There's a star with a tail on it, real low in the south. A little tail.",
      "sources": [
        {
          "file": "src/core/radio.ts",
          "line": 135,
          "group": "BOY_CALL"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "62c092c096e2185b",
      "voice": "boy",
      "text": "I'm calling from my dad's place, out on the ranch. There's a light over the mesa too. It isn't moving.",
      "sources": [
        {
          "file": "src/core/radio.ts",
          "line": 137,
          "group": "BOY_CALL"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b683f3998c005cc1",
      "voice": "boy",
      "text": "He's out with the men. It's hot out. It's July.",
      "sources": [
        {
          "file": "src/core/radio.ts",
          "line": 139,
          "group": "BOY_CALL"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ecb2e42ca2955137",
      "voice": "woman",
      "text": "Earl? I can't sleep. The wind stopped all at once tonight, like somebody shut a door.",
      "sources": [
        {
          "file": "src/story/tripRadio.ts",
          "line": 58,
          "group": "PROGRAMME"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "7e409ca3b75f7e20",
      "voice": "woman",
      "text": "I drove past the motor court a while ago. There's somebody sitting up on the roof. Small. Real still.",
      "sources": [
        {
          "file": "src/story/tripRadio.ts",
          "line": 62,
          "group": "PROGRAMME"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "95c7de03aea281a3",
      "voice": "old",
      "text": "Earl, you know the old survey station, out the gravel west of the highway?",
      "sources": [
        {
          "file": "src/story/tripRadio.ts",
          "line": 67,
          "group": "PROGRAMME"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "2d085ed0881102e8",
      "voice": "old",
      "text": "Somebody put a new chain on it. Shiny. Who buys a new chain for a place nobody goes?",
      "sources": [
        {
          "file": "src/story/tripRadio.ts",
          "line": 69,
          "group": "PROGRAMME"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c284a4332c75325b",
      "voice": "man",
      "text": "Earl, somebody's been cutting my fence on the Hondo road. Both ends, clean, like with bolt cutters.",
      "sources": [
        {
          "file": "src/story/tripRadio.ts",
          "line": 80,
          "group": "PROGRAMME"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "1e02934641a8316e",
      "voice": "man",
      "text": "Wind don't carry bolt cutters.",
      "sources": [
        {
          "file": "src/story/tripRadio.ts",
          "line": 81,
          "group": "PROGRAMME"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "014e09c1ee5284f7",
      "voice": "woman",
      "text": "Earl, it's Dolores again. There's a light on out at the old survey station.",
      "sources": [
        {
          "file": "src/story/tripRadio.ts",
          "line": 84,
          "group": "PROGRAMME"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "98ca58e7b86c541a",
      "voice": "woman",
      "text": "The big gate. Not the little one beside it.",
      "sources": [
        {
          "file": "src/story/tripRadio.ts",
          "line": 85,
          "group": "PROGRAMME"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "17b3e9065c061766",
      "voice": "man",
      "text": "Earl, I drove out the survey track tonight. Just to see.",
      "sources": [
        {
          "file": "src/story/tripRadio.ts",
          "line": 104,
          "group": "PROGRAMME"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "3ce0eadf90ac1b18",
      "voice": "man",
      "text": "Chained, like you said. And it took me the longest time to find the highway again. It's one road, Earl.",
      "sources": [
        {
          "file": "src/story/tripRadio.ts",
          "line": 105,
          "group": "PROGRAMME"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d1b2a7294c7db6ce",
      "voice": "old",
      "text": "Earl, is the old Roswell road open past the diner yet?",
      "sources": [
        {
          "file": "src/story/tripRadio.ts",
          "line": 109,
          "group": "PROGRAMME"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "fd5cb5d2764ce941",
      "voice": "woman",
      "text": "Earl, I'm down at the Mesa. She says tell you the coffee's fresh and the pie isn't.",
      "sources": [
        {
          "file": "src/story/tripRadio.ts",
          "line": 114,
          "group": "PROGRAMME"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "54fffedba835a228",
      "voice": "woman",
      "text": "Earl, there's a light sitting over the mesa east of town. It isn't a star. Stars don't sit that low.",
      "sources": [
        {
          "file": "src/story/tripRadio.ts",
          "line": 123,
          "group": "PROGRAMME"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "f0a8133593565a22",
      "voice": "woman",
      "text": "It's watching the road.",
      "sources": [
        {
          "file": "src/story/tripRadio.ts",
          "line": 124,
          "group": "PROGRAMME"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "75cf70ed26245b6c",
      "voice": "man",
      "text": "Earl, those big dishes up at the observatory. Did they all turn at once tonight?",
      "sources": [
        {
          "file": "src/story/tripRadio.ts",
          "line": 128,
          "group": "PROGRAMME"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ea163bffa8cbd703",
      "voice": "man",
      "text": "A little after two. All of them together, like sunflowers.",
      "sources": [
        {
          "file": "src/story/tripRadio.ts",
          "line": 129,
          "group": "PROGRAMME"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "84bbb99bd8755c87",
      "voice": "news",
      "text": "We interrupt this program. This is a local news bulletin.",
      "sources": [
        {
          "file": "src/story/nightEvents.ts",
          "line": 29,
          "group": "BULLETIN"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b071311d4881f62d",
      "voice": "news",
      "text": "Roswell, New Mexico. Tuesday, July eighth, nineteen forty-seven.",
      "sources": [
        {
          "file": "src/story/nightEvents.ts",
          "line": 30,
          "group": "BULLETIN"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ff6583c326f63f75",
      "voice": "news",
      "text": "A flying disc is reported recovered on a ranch outside town. That is the wording on the notice.",
      "sources": [
        {
          "file": "src/story/nightEvents.ts",
          "line": 31,
          "group": "BULLETIN"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "24cbc90ea47a4267",
      "voice": "news",
      "text": "There is no description of the object. The space for the name of the person reporting it is blank.",
      "sources": [
        {
          "file": "src/story/nightEvents.ts",
          "line": 32,
          "group": "BULLETIN"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "57c913f626216f0a",
      "voice": "news",
      "text": "We have received the same line twice. We are reading it just as it came through.",
      "sources": [
        {
          "file": "src/story/nightEvents.ts",
          "line": 33,
          "group": "BULLETIN"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "17798887be16c20b",
      "voice": "news",
      "text": "Please stand by. We will return to our regular program.",
      "sources": [
        {
          "file": "src/story/nightEvents.ts",
          "line": 34,
          "group": "BULLETIN"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
